      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that the peace i wanted... it doesnt feel like peace. it feels like a void. i thought being alone would make things simple, but everything is just heavy now. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end, but i'm too scared to actually do anything about it. it just feels so permanent and stuck.",
